---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Open Ink Studio, a working name for an original print-on-demand design brand in early preparation." path="about/">
  <div class="wrap page-body"><h1>About</h1>
    <div class="read">
      <p>Open Ink Studio is a <strong>working name</strong> for a new brand that plans to offer original designs on T-shirts, mugs, posters and stickers, made to order through a print-on-demand provider.</p>
      <p>The brand is at the concept stage. There is no shop, no prices and no accounts with any marketplace or provider yet.</p>
      <h2>Our design rules</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Original artwork only, made for this brand.</li>
        <li>No trademarks, brand logos, characters or celebrity likenesses.</li>
        <li>No copied or traced artwork.</li>
        <li>Previews are labelled as concepts until a product genuinely exists.</li>
      </ul>
    </div></div>
</Base>
